## Support Info

* Shell access whilst the container is running:

    ```bash
    docker exec -it {{ rt.container_name }} /bin/bash
    ```

* To monitor the logs of the container in realtime:

    ```bash
    docker logs -f {{ rt.container_name }}
    ```

* Container version number:

    ```bash
    docker inspect -f {% raw %}'{{ index .Config.Labels "build_version" }}'{% endraw %} {{ rt.container_name }}
    ```

* Image version number:

    ```bash
    docker inspect -f {% raw %}'{{ index .Config.Labels "build_version" }}'{% endraw %} {{ image_ref }}
    ```
